WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:03.140
It's time to thread up the machine.

2
00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:05.460
Working on the right side of the mast,

3
00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:09.220
thread the yarn into the
triangular yarn guide.

4
00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:13.260
Then, pass the working yarn
between the tension discs.

5
00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:14.900
Set the dial to the middle.

6
00:00:14.930 --> 00:00:17.060
setting initially.

7
00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:21.360
Then thread the front yarn guide as shown.

8
00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:32.140
Put the loop that is formed into that thin

9
00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:36.820
mast tension wire and secure
the yarn end in the mast

10
00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:37.480
yarn clip.

